{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDI0L1VuZGVyLXRoZS1CcmlkZ2UtJTI4MjAyNC0lMjkv","type":"series","name":"Under the Bridge","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/4YMpCGsAAHXWGScHsK1sbd7wprE.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zooSXzEZCqULXUZZpwqiLEGcid7.jpg","description":"Fourteen-year old Reena Virk went to join friends at a party and never returned home. Through the eyes of Rebecca Godfrey and a local police officer, learn the hidden world of the young girls accused of the murder — revealing startling truths about the unlikely killer.\n\nRated TV-MA · Ended · First aired 17 Apr 2024 · United States of America · Language: English\nStudio: Best Day Ever Productions, ABC Signature · Network: Hulu\n\nComplete series. On your server: S1 8/8\n\nOn your server — Audio: English","releaseInfo":"2024","genres":["Drama","Crime","English"],"videos":[{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDI0L1VuZGVyLXRoZS1CcmlkZ2UtJTI4MjAyNC0lMjkv.1.1","title":"Looking Glass","season":1,"episode":1,"released":"2024-04-17T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"In 1997, on a quiet island in BC, fourteen-year-old Reena Virk attends a party and never returns home. Her disappearance intrigues a novelist returning to her hometown, who finds herself drawn into the hidden world of the teen suspects…","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7qi6vnEA0objykuBWqqZHkSOPPA.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDI0L1VuZGVyLXRoZS1CcmlkZ2UtJTI4MjAyNC0lMjkv.1.2","title":"The John Gotti of Seven Oaks","season":1,"episode":2,"released":"2024-04-17T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Cam is thrown by a shocking discovery, and the police rush to unravel what really happened under the bridge. Josephine makes a deal with Rebecca, while a look into the past reveals Reena's first rebellion.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/q17FPMCSB7rirp1cmvTnJUQ1PYl.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDI0L1VuZGVyLXRoZS1CcmlkZ2UtJTI4MjAyNC0lMjkv.1.3","title":"Blood Oath","season":1,"episode":3,"released":"2024-04-24T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Upsetting news shakes the small town of Victoria, and as rumors surface, Rebecca and Cam reconnect. In the past, Reena enters Josephine's mafia fantasy world.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/pHjod7NB0462ZYKQE71PJWuEBTh.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDI0L1VuZGVyLXRoZS1CcmlkZ2UtJTI4MjAyNC0lMjkv.1.4","title":"Beautiful British Columbia","season":1,"episode":4,"released":"2024-05-01T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"In 1979, Suman and Manjit fall in love, setting into motion a series of events that will change their lives forever. In 1997, the Seven Oaks girls come to the Virk house for a dinner to remember, leading to the shocking revelation of Manjit's secret.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/anG6alKqGPuvSyxWcIfprmiEqKu.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDI0L1VuZGVyLXRoZS1CcmlkZ2UtJTI4MjAyNC0lMjkv.1.5","title":"When the Heat Comes Down","season":1,"episode":5,"released":"2024-05-08T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Tensions rise as suspicions surround the teens. Rebecca and Cam hatch a plan — but an unexpected detour leads Rebecca down a strange rabbit hole, resulting in a new bond.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5OTIRIjLCWQMwsGdKDOu6NQyrS2.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDI0L1VuZGVyLXRoZS1CcmlkZ2UtJTI4MjAyNC0lMjkv.1.6","title":"In Water They Sink As the Same","season":1,"episode":6,"released":"2024-05-15T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Past and present wounds entwine as Rebecca and Cam's alliance is tested. The Virks discuss taking matters into their own hands, and the teens use a school dance as cover for their escape plan — all as another life is threatened.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5UEj0UIRrMdeSLiR8c6F03xVqSq.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDI0L1VuZGVyLXRoZS1CcmlkZ2UtJTI4MjAyNC0lMjkv.1.7","title":"Three and Seven","season":1,"episode":7,"released":"2024-05-22T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"The unfolding trial pushes Rebecca to the brink as she begins to question who she should defend. Cam's allegiance to the justice system is tested as details from the night of the murder are finally revealed.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/e2crzjOnUt7dY7rneNbYVEJDdBc.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDI0L1VuZGVyLXRoZS1CcmlkZ2UtJTI4MjAyNC0lMjkv.1.8","title":"Mercy Alone","season":1,"episode":8,"released":"2024-05-29T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"The last opportunity for justice arrives as all the participants reckon with their true involvement in the events that transpired. A radical choice of forgiveness allows for closure.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7Rz3pwgD7pSOZicw10DKBGcmYt3.jpg"}],"imdbRating":"7.7","cast":["Lily Gladstone","Riley Keough","Vritika Gupta","Chloe Guidry","Javon Walton","Izzy G.","Aiyana Goodfellow","Ezra Faroque Khan"],"director":["Quinn Shephard"],"released":"2024-04-17T00:00:00.000Z","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Quinn Shephard","character":"Director","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/jkpRJC7IDQnY0WVhjhMaSTBWunj.jpg"},{"name":"Lily Gladstone","character":"Cam Bentland","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/zYAN84WqZv2sbVE2JDkcWoXGoF7.jpg"},{"name":"Riley Keough","character":"Rebecca Godfrey","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/du1FYr5dTQL6gCMX6ISnQBOxz2F.jpg"},{"name":"Vritika Gupta","character":"Reena Virk","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/ouWVNrGfVENyO06WbS9nUyDu95b.jpg"},{"name":"Chloe Guidry","character":"Josephine Bell","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/hTpQKbtguOi5TrS9SBF16Tzo06m.jpg"},{"name":"Javon Walton","character":"Warren Glowatski","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/zvyX5X